' Legend
' =====================================
legend right
    |= Component |= Color |= Description |
    | Shop Side | <color:#E3F2FD>Blue</color> | OXID eShop frontend |
    | API Layer | <color:#FFF9C4>Yellow</color> | Testing Port API |
    | Security | <color:#FFCCBC>Orange</color> | Authentication & validation |
    | Testing | <color:#C8E6C9>Green</color> | E2E test framework |
    | Monitoring | <color:#F8BBD0>Pink</color> | Real-time monitoring |
    | Database | <color:#E1BEE7>Purple</color> | Data storage |

    **Key Features:**
    • Secure HMAC-signed requests
    • Real-time order data access
    • E2E testing integration
    • Production monitoring
    • PCI-DSS compliant
    • Zero shop performance impact
endlegend

@enduml
